{"schema_version": "1.0", "session_id": "75ffc6f4-ef67-464a-88d7-a6b88e9a5475", "team_id": "contest2026_324_xiaoqiaoliushui", "github_login": "Geoorgiee", "tool": "claude-code", "seq": 25, "ts": "2026-08-28T08:38:12.307Z", "role": "tool", "tool_name": "<result>", "tool_call_id": "call_6c258b790a4e48bfbd96d55e", "input": null, "output": "<system-reminder>This memory is 3 days old. Memories are point-in-time observations, not live state — claims about code behavior or file:line citations may be outdated. Verify against current code before asserting as fact.</system-reminder>\n1\t---\n2\tname: ai-coding-log-guide\n3\tdescription: AI Coding 日志归集与提交手册\n4\tmetadata: \n5\t  node_type: memory\n6\t  type: reference\n7\t  url: https://github.com/open-vela/docs/blob/dev-ai-contest-2026/zh-cn/contest_2026/ai_coding_log_guide.md\n8\t  originSessionId: b4c62d37-bd19-4722-9945-41e2b2022078\n9\t  modified: 2026-08-24T15:09:48.592Z\n10\t---\n11\t\n12\t## 文档来源\n13\t\n14\tAI Coding 日志归集与提交手册，面向参赛者说明如何将 AI 对话日志归集并提交至比赛仓库。\n15\t\n16\t## 关键机制\n17\t\n18\t- **工作区闸门（Workspace Gate）** - 通过识别 `.repo/` 目录，仅在 openvela 工作区内采集\n19\t- **staging（本机缓冲区）** - 位于 `~/.claude/contest-collector-staging/`\n20\t- **自动入仓** - 会话结束时自动写入比赛仓库 `logs/` 目录\n21\t- **hook（钩子）** - 随安装部署，会话结束时自动触发日志流转\n22\t\n23\t## 全流程\n24\t\n25\t```bash\n26\t# 1. 安装（仅需一次）\n27\tcd <demo仓>\n28\tbash ../.claude/skills/contest-log-collector/onboarding/install.sh \\\n29\t  --team-id contest2026_<编号>_<队伍名> \\\n30\t  --github-login <GitHub username>\n31\t\n32\t# 2. 健康检查\n33\tbash ../.claude/skills/contest-log-collector/onboarding/verify-setup.sh\n34\t\n35\t# 3. 开发 - 在 openvela 工作区内使用 AI 工具\n36\t\n37\t# 4. 提交\n38\tgit add logs/\n39\tgit commit -s -m \"logs: sync AI sessions\"\n40\tgit push\n41\t```\n42\t\n43\t## 支持的 AI 工具\n44\t\n45\t1. **Claude Code** - 官方主推，支持 CLI 与 AIoT-IDE 内嵌\n46\t2. **OpenCode** - CLI / TUI / VS Code 扩展\n47\t3. **Codex CLI**\n48\t\n49\t## 身份配置文件\n50\t\n51\t`~/.claude/contest-collector.env`:\n52\t```\n53\tTEAM_ID=contest2026_<编号>_<队伍名>\n54\tGITHUB_LOGIN=<GitHub username>\n55\t```\n56\t\n57\t## 手动工具\n58\t\n59\t```bash\n60\tcontest-snapshot --list                    # 列出已采集会话\n61\tcontest-snapshot --session <session-id>    # 预览特定会话\n62\tcontest-snapshot --today --confirm         # 手动同步当天会话\n63\t```\n64\t\n65\t## 相关记忆\n66\t\n67\t- [[esp32p4-adaptation]] - ESP32-P4 平台适配\n68\t- [[hardware-porting-track]] - 硬件移植赛道指南\n69\t", "is_error": false}
